<app-nav/><view class="page"><view class="hero"><view class="eyebrow">努力看得见</view><view class="title">成长积分</view><view class="subtitle">每一笔奖励与调整，都有清晰记录。</view></view><state-view loading="{{loading}}" error="{{error}}" bindretry="retry"/><block wx:if="{{!loading && !error}}"><student-picker students="{{students}}" selected="{{studentIds}}" bindchange="pickStudents"/><view class="metric"><view class="metric-value">{{balance}}</view><view class="metric-label">当前成长积分</view></view><view class="notice gap"><view wx:for="{{rules}}" wx:key="name">{{item.name}}：+{{item.points}} 分</view><view class="small-gap">实际入账由服务端判定，同一事件不重复奖励。</view></view><view wx:if="{{teacher}}" class="card"><view class="card-title">人工奖励 / 调整</view><view class="field gap"><text class="label">调整积分（-100 至 100）</text><input value="{{amount}}" data-field="amount" bindinput="field" placeholder="奖励填正数，扣减填负数"/></view><view class="field"><text class="label">调整原因 *</text><textarea value="{{reason}}" data-field="reason" bindinput="field" maxlength="500" placeholder="例如：主动帮助同学"/></view><view class="hint">不可透支。网络失败后重试相同内容会复用本次请求编号。</view><button class="primary gap" bindtap="submit" disabled="{{busy || !studentIds.length}}" loading="{{busy}}">确认调整积分</button></view><view wx:if="{{actionError}}" class="error">{{actionError}}</view><view class="card gap"><view class="card-title">积分流水</view><view wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id" class="list-row"><view class="row"><view class="col"><view>{{item.reason || item.typeText}}</view><view class="hint">{{item.createdText}}</view></view><view><view class="{{item.amount > 0 ? 'number-positive' : 'number-negative'}}">{{item.amount > 0 ? '+' : ''}}{{item.amount}}</view><view class="hint">余额 {{item.balance}}</view></view></view></view><view wx:if="{{!items.length}}" class="empty-inline">暂无积分变动记录</view></view></block></view>
